    "claims": [
      "Calculates full packing proposals including auxiliary packaging materials",
      "Shows storage locations, weights and volumes at each packing level",
      "Delivery proposals plan dispatch based on availability",
      "Applies customer rules such as single-item pallets or mixed packages",
      "Manages packaging materials such as pallets, cages, KLTs and containers per customer",
      "Dispatch planning journal",
      "Groups shipments, orders and transfers into dispatch orders and tours, incoming too",
      "Generates SSCC and GS1 goods labels and license plates",
      "Tracks package accounts such as Euro pallets and invoices packaging used",
      "Produces forwarding orders, CMR and extended packing lists",
      "Works with Yaveon 365 Mobile Dispatch, EDI and Automotive",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
